    <briefdescription>
<para>Unified error handling and recovery for tensor updates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>ThemisDB EPIC 3 Implementation Team </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-07-03</para>
</simplesect>
This header defines unified error handling and recovery strategies for various failure modes in tensor artifact updates.</para>
<sect1 id="error__recovery__handler_8h_1autotoc_md7_1s1"><sect2 id="error__recovery__handler_8h_1autotoc_md7">
<title>Failure Modes Handled</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Failed partial refit → Fallback to rebuild</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Rank cap breach → Abort update and trigger rebuild</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Residual breach → Reject update, mark stale</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Lock timeout → Release and escalate to worker priority queue</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Checkpoint corruption → Delete and continue</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Update timeout → Mark artifact stale and continue </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
